        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Plants: Nicotiana, Encyclia\n- Organisms: Rhodococcus fascians\n- Taxonomy: Solanaceae, orchids\n- Places: Americas, Australia, south west Africa, South Pacific\n\nFacts:\n- Nicotiana is a genus of herbaceous plants and shrubs in the family Solanaceae.\n- Nicotiana is indigenous to the Americas, Australia, south west Africa, and the South Pacific.\n- Encyclia is a genus of orchids.\n- Rhodococcus fascians commonly afflicts Nicotiana plants.\n- Rhodococcus fascians is an agriculturally significant pathogen because it commonly afflicts Nicotiana plants.",
